msgid "Mailing List Integration is the ChatBot addon that lets you connect with your Mailchimp and Zapier accounts. You can add new subscribers to your Mailchimp Lists from the ChatBot and unsubscribe them. You can also create new Zap on your Zapier Account and connect with this addon."
